WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,020
You're definitely going to lose now

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:06,430
My team not only rushes to the green, but also has a high score

3
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:11,430
There is also a strong man who can lift the fourth gear

4
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:17,470
My people haven't finished testing yet.

5
00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:19,470
Although I lost in terms of quantity

6
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:24,470
But what if we have someone here who can lift the fifth gear?

7
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:29,630
Is it that easy for you to lift the fifth gear?

8
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:31,630
Today I will put my words here

9
00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:35,630
If there is someone in your team who can lift the fifth time slot

10
00:00:35,630 --> 00:00:38,630
Not only do I lose this bet, I also turn my back to you.

11
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:42,790
But if it doesn't show up, how about you turn your back and ask me?

12
00:00:42,790 --> 00:00:44,920
Okay, I'll bet you

13
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,920
You really dare to bet

14
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,920
How many times have I laid down on the battlefield?

15
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:49,920
What's there to be afraid of?

16
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:50,920
Just twenty meals

17
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:53,920
It's enough to cut off a few more ears on the battlefield.

18
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:54,920
Just be tough

19
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:55,920
I'm not a tough talker

20
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:57,920
My left eye twitched when I went out today

21
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:59,920
This means good things are coming
